WEBVTT

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling, open up your eyes!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling me wo akete

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
It is in this world's evil den

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
Kono yo no aku no soukutsu de

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
You shall receive a rare heart

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
Tsuibamareru kokoro hoshikute

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Escaping is impossible

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Nige mo dekinu

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
My imprisoned, pale-faced prince

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
Yuuhei no souhaku no ouji yo

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
I am a goddess

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
Watashi ga megami

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Kami-chama Karin

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Mini-Goddess Karin

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
In this ward, you have to poach everything

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
Subete wa mitsuryouku

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
With a hidden snare

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
Usumoreta wana ni

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
If you entrap them

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
Hamerareru no nara

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
You'll want to destroy them too…

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
Konagona ni kudaite hoshii wa

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
To die from natural causes or imcompetence

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
Shi ni itaranu yamai

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
It's all poison to your heart

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
Shinzou ni ha pawazon

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
A rose melting in the flames of purgatory

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
Rengoku no homura de zero kara

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Let's redeem this world…

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Saisei shimashou

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
A black dahlia in the nightless city's sky

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
Fuyoru no sora de kuroi daria

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
A lost delusion, a falling reality

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
Shisuru mousou ochiru genjitsu

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Struggling in hell like an ant

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Mogake ari jigoku

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling, give me your voice!

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling koe agete

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
For right now, our limits will have to change

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
Kono ima sashichigaeru hodo

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
If we want for the most important thing

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
Daiji na mono ga hoshii no nara

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Discover the result of your prayers

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Inori wa hatete

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Your princess is dying in prison

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Rougoku de shouten no himegimi

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
You are such a devil…

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
Anata ga maou

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Hate's fist and grief's wounds, too

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Ikari no ken mo nageki no kizu mo

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Dissolving, vanishing, unraveling, passing away, without a trace

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Atokata mo naku tokete kiete chitte utakata

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:36.380
The Mysterious Transfer Student is Cool

00:01:36.380 --> 00:01:39.300
You lost the ring!?

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:41.760
Eh, well…

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:44.810
Aren't you a little too careless?

00:01:45.470 --> 00:01:49.770
You're not aware… of just how important that ring is!

00:01:49.770 --> 00:01:51.360
I know!

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:54.020
To me, it is…

00:01:54.360 --> 00:01:59.700
an important memento of my deceased father and mother.

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:01.820
If you understand…

00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:04.120
Kazune-chan.

00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:08.410
You shouldn't get so angry.

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:15.340
I'm sure Karin-chan didn't lose it on purpose.

00:02:15.340 --> 00:02:17.340
Thank you, Himeka-chan.

00:02:17.340 --> 00:02:18.920
I guess it can't be helped.

00:02:19.510 --> 00:02:20.680
When did it go missing?

00:02:22.510 --> 00:02:25.510
I think I still had it during the school festival.

00:02:25.510 --> 00:02:29.140
Which means you've lost it sometime between leaving the school festival and coming back home.

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:30.600
Can you remember what you did around then?

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:36.110
Well, I worked at the coffee shop…

00:02:36.110 --> 00:02:37.490
And after that…

00:02:39.150 --> 00:02:41.320
Me and Kirika-senpai…

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:50.920
Karasuma Kirika?

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:53.080
That's suspicious.

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:55.920
Kirika-senpai? Why?

00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:58.670
He is Karasuma Kirio's younger brother.

00:02:58.670 --> 00:03:00.630
It wouldn't be strange for him to target the ring.

00:03:00.630 --> 00:03:02.650
That's… not true.

00:03:02.650 --> 00:03:04.350
That's… not true.

00:03:12.140 --> 00:03:14.730
Now that Karin can't become a goddess…

00:03:14.730 --> 00:03:16.610
What if Himeka gets targeted?

00:03:24.910 --> 00:03:26.540
Himeka-chan! Karin-chan!

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:28.740
Himeka-chan! Karin-chan!

00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:31.660
Good morning, Kazune-kun.

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:32.080
'Sup.

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:34.830
Good morning.

00:03:37.340 --> 00:03:41.420
There is no way that Kirika-senpai stole the ring.

00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:45.640
Karin-chan. Cheer up.

00:03:45.640 --> 00:03:47.720
Karin-chan. Cheer up.

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:48.430
Okay.

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:01.320
Waa, handsome guy.

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:02.860
I haven't seen him around.

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:04.200
I wonder if he's a transfer student.

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:12.960
Good morning.

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:14.920
G-Good morning.

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:18.500
Well-well, Hanazono-san is already getting exited.

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:20.670
No! That's not it.

00:04:21.630 --> 00:04:22.920
Hanazono-san?

00:04:22.920 --> 00:04:25.590
Yes, I am Hanazono Karin.

00:04:25.590 --> 00:04:27.800
Are you that Hanazono-san?

00:04:44.740 --> 00:04:46.110
I'm glad I got to meet you.

00:04:47.110 --> 00:04:49.200
Ah! To kiss in the morning…

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:50.830
Kiss in the morning!

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:52.580
I'm so jealous!

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:54.540
We're so jealous!

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:56.040
No, that's not it.

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:57.460
That's not it.

00:04:57.460 --> 00:04:59.840
Our aim is Kujyou-kun!

00:04:59.840 --> 00:05:02.250
Right? Kujyou-kun?

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:12.220
You're… from Professor Kujyou's family, that Kazune-kun?

00:05:12.810 --> 00:05:14.680
That's right. How did you-

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:30.160
I'm glad I got to meet you.

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:31.830
Did you see?

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:32.950
Yes, we did!

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:35.000
He kissed Kujyou-kun!

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:37.000
Which means…

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:39.750
If you kiss that pretty boy…

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:41.880
…you'll have had an indirect kiss with Kujyou-kun!

00:05:42.290 --> 00:05:44.800
Two birds with one stone!

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:47.010
We're glad we got to meet you too!

00:05:47.010 --> 00:05:48.880
- Oh, nooo!

00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:50.140
- Wait!

00:05:50.140 --> 00:05:54.140
Are you okay, Kazune-chan?

00:05:54.140 --> 00:05:56.730
Ah! Keep it together.

00:05:57.890 --> 00:05:59.690
That ring…

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:05.690
I'm Nishikiyori Michiru.

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:08.280
I've been living in England up until now.

00:06:08.900 --> 00:06:15.040
I have been hospitalized for the past year, and so I'm a year older than you all. Pleased to meet you all.

00:06:22.590 --> 00:06:25.210
Hey, why do you know about me?

00:06:26.300 --> 00:06:28.880
Didn't you say you were Karin Hanazono yourself?

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:30.720
That's not what I mean.

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:33.050
Why do you know about my deceased father?

00:06:33.800 --> 00:06:36.220
Because I'm his reincarnation.

00:06:36.220 --> 00:06:36.850
Hey!

00:06:40.520 --> 00:06:42.230
Answer me seriously.

00:06:42.230 --> 00:06:45.440
Professor Kujyou took care of me while I was in England.

00:06:46.030 --> 00:06:47.900
With uncle?

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:49.200
Uncle?

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:50.700
So then… you are...

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:56.160
Kujyou Himeka. Kazune-chan's younger sister.

00:06:57.870 --> 00:06:59.660
Pardon me.

00:06:59.660 --> 00:07:00.750
Nice to meet you.

00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:02.540
Likewise.

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:07.380
Hey, show me your ring.

00:07:08.510 --> 00:07:10.800
Ring? Go ahead.

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:21.440
It's not it. It has a completely different design to my ring.

00:07:22.190 --> 00:07:24.230
It's my treasure.

00:07:25.190 --> 00:07:27.190
I see. It sure is pretty.

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:30.360
It is something I received from Professor Kujyou.

00:07:31.530 --> 00:07:33.030
What do you mean?

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:35.240
Just that.

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:40.750
Do you think it's weird for a boy to treasure a ring?

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:42.040
That's prejudice.

00:07:46.170 --> 00:07:47.250
Kazune-kun?

00:07:51.130 --> 00:07:52.840
Ah, Himeka-chan.

00:07:54.050 --> 00:07:58.010
It's our turn to get the supplies for the next class.

00:07:58.010 --> 00:08:01.390
Ah, yes.

00:08:07.060 --> 00:08:11.190
I guess that ring wasn't mine. I need to seriously search for it.

00:08:14.740 --> 00:08:17.910
I wonder if Nishikiyori-kun's is real.

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:22.460
If it really did come from my father.

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:23.370
Then it's real.

00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:26.880
Does that mean that Nishikiyori-kun can transform as well?

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:30.380
If that's the case, let's become allies!

00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:34.800
I can't figure out what he's thinking down in his heart.

00:08:35.260 --> 00:08:38.350
But, if he has gotten it from your father…

00:08:38.350 --> 00:08:41.520
We still don't know if that story is true or not.

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:47.480
If we get pulled into an awkward situation, and something were to happen to Himeka…

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:49.320
Hey, Kazune-kun.

00:08:50.110 --> 00:08:52.230
I've been wanting to ask this for awhile now…

00:08:52.230 --> 00:08:55.610
Why will Himeka-chan disappear if she isn't protected?

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:03.700
There is… another Himeka.

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:08.580
There's the Himeka that's with us.

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:10.210
And there is another one.

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:15.010
The two are living on an incredibly delicate balance.

00:09:20.140 --> 00:09:22.770
Why is there another Himeka?

00:09:23.430 --> 00:09:26.230
I don't know the reason either.

00:09:26.690 --> 00:09:29.520
There are two Himeka-chans?

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:34.610
The other Himeka is with Karasuma.

00:09:34.990 --> 00:09:36.530
With that glasses guy?

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:40.410
Karasuma is trying to get rid of our Himeka.

00:09:41.450 --> 00:09:42.910
If he doesn't,…

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:45.960
their own Himeka will disappear.

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:47.370
Or so he thinks.

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:48.830
That's…

00:09:52.550 --> 00:09:56.800
Isn't there a way to save both Himeka-chans?

00:09:57.760 --> 00:09:59.890
Quickly, using godly powers.

00:09:59.890 --> 00:10:02.260
If that could be done, I would've done it.

00:10:02.640 --> 00:10:03.720
That's what I want too.

00:10:03.970 --> 00:10:06.480
Well then, let's work together with the glasses guy!

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:08.850
He isn't someone that would listen.

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:10.400
No way.

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:13.730
Besides, in the worst case, even if we tried to save them both,…

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:15.900
there is a chance that we won't keep either of them.

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:17.190
What do you mean?

00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:23.120
That itself, could cause the delicate balance to collapse, and both could disappear.

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:28.500
That's why I just have to protect her at this point.

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:30.790
Listen carefully, Karin.

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:33.590
Whatever you do, don't mess with the Karasumas.

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:38.220
We don't want to cause the balance to collapse.

00:10:39.010 --> 00:10:40.050
Okay.

00:10:40.050 --> 00:10:42.850
It's okay if you just protect Himeka.

00:10:43.890 --> 00:10:46.770
For that purpose, we need to find that ring.

00:10:48.180 --> 00:10:52.230
If someone who also has godly power wears that ring like this,…

00:10:52.230 --> 00:10:53.400
we would know where it is by it's reaction.

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:56.030
What if someone without godly powers puts it on?

00:10:56.780 --> 00:10:58.780
Then we'd have to search for it by foot.

00:10:59.780 --> 00:11:01.070
Kazune-kun.

00:11:01.360 --> 00:11:03.990
I'm sorry, please leave me alone for a bit.

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:06.790
Karin-chan.

00:11:08.450 --> 00:11:12.000
Is Kazune-chan alright?

00:11:12.210 --> 00:11:14.460
Yes. How is Nishikiyori-kun?

00:11:15.170 --> 00:11:17.380
It seems he went off somewhere.

00:11:23.340 --> 00:11:24.850
Karasuma Kirika-san?

00:11:28.560 --> 00:11:31.350
Dammit, no reaction at all.

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:36.940
He…

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:38.280
What is he doing with Karasuma?

00:11:51.080 --> 00:11:53.000
Still no reaction.

00:11:54.330 --> 00:11:56.960
Anyways, I really have to find that ring.

00:11:56.960 --> 00:11:58.710
You're right.

00:12:01.090 --> 00:12:02.340
Nishikiyori-kun.

00:12:05.550 --> 00:12:07.760
What's with him? So unsociable.

00:12:08.140 --> 00:12:10.680
It's like he's a different person than before.

00:12:15.560 --> 00:12:16.690
What's wrong?

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:19.150
Nothing.

00:12:19.160 --> 00:12:21.040
Student Council Office

00:12:22.190 --> 00:12:23.110
This is unusual.

00:12:23.820 --> 00:12:26.530
Is Kujyou Kazune wearing his ring?

00:12:28.910 --> 00:12:32.710
Is he worried because the amateur goddess has lost her ring?

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:36.790
This is a chance to fight them!

00:12:37.260 --> 00:12:38.250
Is it grilled
eel over rice?

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:41.790
I am God!

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:46.750
You moron.

00:12:45.730 --> 00:12:46.750
It's a croquette!

00:12:50.810 --> 00:12:52.220
Did you find it?

00:12:53.390 --> 00:12:55.100
It's nowhere to be found.

00:12:56.940 --> 00:12:59.060
Where did it do?

00:12:59.060 --> 00:13:00.270
Wait.

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:03.030
Did you find my ring?

00:13:03.400 --> 00:13:04.780
No,…

00:13:04.780 --> 00:13:06.660
this is a different reaction.

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:07.990
A different one?

00:13:07.990 --> 00:13:09.740
It can't be helped that I have been discovered.

00:13:11.620 --> 00:13:13.200
It's the planty glasses guy!

00:13:13.620 --> 00:13:14.710
Silence!

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:16.710
I'm not "planty glasses guy".

00:13:16.710 --> 00:13:18.210
I'm Karasuma Kirio.

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:22.090
You were in that kind of place.

00:13:22.420 --> 00:13:23.380
That's correct.

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:25.970
The reaction from that ring came from my ring.

00:13:26.470 --> 00:13:28.390
You're not wearing your ring…

00:13:30.640 --> 00:13:31.260
Huh?

00:13:32.680 --> 00:13:35.770
This reaction… There's someone else over there!

00:13:45.690 --> 00:13:47.490
It's that woman from before!

00:13:49.320 --> 00:13:52.280
Battle Transformation, using Hades' Power!

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:05.630
An amateur goddess with no ring is a useless existence.

00:14:06.090 --> 00:14:07.590
Why do you know about the ring?!

00:14:07.590 --> 00:14:09.510
It cannot be helped that I've been found out.

00:14:09.800 --> 00:14:11.430
- Huh?
- Huh?

00:14:11.640 --> 00:14:14.390
We indeed have the Athena ring.

00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:22.230
You have it!?

00:14:24.110 --> 00:14:25.530
You didn't know?

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:28.820
Thank goodness.

00:14:28.820 --> 00:14:31.280
It wasn't Kirika-senpai after all.

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:36.750
Karin, take Himeka and run away.

00:14:42.380 --> 00:14:43.710
Ego sumo deus.

00:14:42.380 --> 00:14:45.710
<u>Ego sumo deus:</u> Latin for "I become god"

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:48.380
Is that a god?

00:14:51.590 --> 00:14:53.390
I did it again.

00:14:53.390 --> 00:14:55.770
I told them everything again.

00:14:56.100 --> 00:14:57.060
Go, Karin.

00:14:57.390 --> 00:15:00.230
But, I can't just leave you…

00:15:00.230 --> 00:15:02.610
You won't be of any good if you can't transform, will you?

00:15:02.610 --> 00:15:06.530
That's right, an amateur goddess that can't transform can't do anything!

00:15:06.530 --> 00:15:08.280
That's mean!

00:15:08.280 --> 00:15:09.150
Run!

00:15:10.240 --> 00:15:12.070
Please, run.

00:15:12.570 --> 00:15:13.840
Protect Himeka.

00:15:13.840 --> 00:15:15.330
Kazune-kun.

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:17.240
Himeka-chan.

00:15:17.620 --> 00:15:21.710
Kazune-chan will be fine.

00:15:22.630 --> 00:15:23.790
So, let's go.

00:15:29.510 --> 00:15:31.130
Should I go after those two?

00:15:31.510 --> 00:15:32.050
No.

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:34.550
Please take care of those two.

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:39.310
We need to first defeat the Sun God.

00:15:42.560 --> 00:15:46.440
If I manage to separate them, it should create an opening.

00:15:46.440 --> 00:15:47.650
There's no other way.

00:15:53.860 --> 00:15:56.280
Do you think Kazune-kun will be alright?

00:15:56.280 --> 00:15:58.410
He's fine.

00:15:58.410 --> 00:16:01.830
I believe in him.

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:07.420
Kazune-chan has never betrayed my trust.

00:16:08.340 --> 00:16:09.340
Himeka-chan.

00:16:10.420 --> 00:16:18.560
Besides, if we don't listen to Kazune-chan in times like these, he'll get angry.

00:16:18.970 --> 00:16:20.560
You understand everything well.

00:16:24.520 --> 00:16:26.900
Kujyou-kun.

00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:28.320
Where are you?

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:30.030
Where?

00:16:31.900 --> 00:16:34.990
I see, the godly forms can't be seen by normal humans.

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:40.080
We've come this far, we should be safe.

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:42.790
I suppose you're right.

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:44.540
Karin-chan!

00:16:45.670 --> 00:16:47.460
Shii-chan, what's wrong?

00:16:47.460 --> 00:16:52.010
I thought something was going on, so I got concerned and came here.

00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:56.010
I can feel the intense powers being used.

00:16:56.010 --> 00:16:58.800
Is Kazune-kun okay?

00:17:00.430 --> 00:17:04.230
Jeez! If only I had the power to become a mini-goddess.

00:17:06.900 --> 00:17:09.110
Shii-chan, you're a god, right?

00:17:10.570 --> 00:17:13.070
No, I'm a goddess!

00:17:13.570 --> 00:17:16.450
You can use the godly powers, right?

00:17:17.700 --> 00:17:20.450
Great! I got a god!

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:26.170
Karin-chan!

00:17:31.800 --> 00:17:34.170
Shall I put an end to this?

00:17:35.340 --> 00:17:36.590
Now!

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:38.800
Bushia Tempest!

00:17:45.890 --> 00:17:46.940
You…

00:17:47.650 --> 00:17:50.360
Give me Karin's; Athena's ring back!

00:17:53.530 --> 00:17:54.440
Hurry up!

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:06.250
Can he see us transformed?

00:18:07.820 --> 00:18:09.040
Terebro Nox!

00:18:14.960 --> 00:18:16.760
It seems the tables have turned.

00:18:17.840 --> 00:18:18.590
Take this!

00:18:22.560 --> 00:18:25.980
Karin-chan, this is reckless.

00:18:26.470 --> 00:18:27.390
You win.

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:30.560
Kazune-kun!

00:18:30.560 --> 00:18:32.190
Why did you come back?

00:18:32.190 --> 00:18:34.780
Isn't it obvious? Because I was worried!

00:18:35.570 --> 00:18:37.150
I got it back.

00:18:37.150 --> 00:18:40.200
The ring, your mother's precious memento.

00:18:41.240 --> 00:18:42.620
Kazune-kun.

00:18:43.530 --> 00:18:48.040
You remembered that this ring is a memento.

00:18:49.710 --> 00:18:50.540
Kazune-kun!

00:18:52.500 --> 00:18:54.460
How dare you amateur goddess.

00:19:02.090 --> 00:19:04.510
I am God!

00:19:26.870 --> 00:19:29.500
That's… Hanazono-san's transformation.

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:31.500
Proeli Gradius!

00:19:33.580 --> 00:19:35.170
I'll have you disappear here.

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:39.340
Scary.

00:19:40.090 --> 00:19:46.220
It might be scary, but Kazune-kun has fought all alone, and protected me and Himeka-chan.

00:19:46.510 --> 00:19:49.140
This time, I'll protect you!

00:19:51.270 --> 00:19:52.560
I won't let you.

00:19:59.360 --> 00:20:00.900
Terebro Nox!

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:03.240
Now!

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:05.160
Okay.

00:20:06.530 --> 00:20:07.910
God Thunder!

00:20:13.670 --> 00:20:14.920
I did it!

00:20:16.210 --> 00:20:17.040
You…

00:20:21.720 --> 00:20:23.380
Thanks!

00:20:23.380 --> 00:20:24.680
Who are you?

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:29.770
Kazu-

00:20:29.770 --> 00:20:32.520
Kazune-chan!

00:20:32.520 --> 00:20:35.560
Karin-chan!

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:37.060
Himeka-chan!

00:20:37.570 --> 00:20:40.320
Are you okay?

00:20:40.320 --> 00:20:42.070
We're fine.

00:20:42.070 --> 00:20:43.950
Looks like his batteries are dead though.

00:20:48.780 --> 00:20:50.870
I'm glad.

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:54.790
Don't do anything reckless anymore.

00:21:05.470 --> 00:21:09.510
If something were to happen to Kazune-chan…

00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:13.890
I'd… I'd…

00:21:18.520 --> 00:21:22.990
I see, so the person Himeka-chan likes is…

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:41.210
Hello!

00:21:44.220 --> 00:21:45.590
Kazune-kun!

00:21:45.590 --> 00:21:49.470
Miyon-chan and Yuki-kun came to visit you!

00:21:49.470 --> 00:21:51.350
Yohoo~, Kazune-kun.

00:21:52.140 --> 00:21:53.970
Are you okay now?

00:21:54.560 --> 00:21:56.440
Yes, thank you.

00:21:56.440 --> 00:21:59.810
Yo, Kazune-kun! Did you wake up already?

00:22:00.270 --> 00:22:02.610
Nishikiyori-kun.

00:22:02.610 --> 00:22:05.690
Here, a present straight from the heart.

00:22:06.110 --> 00:22:07.360
I don't need it.

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:10.660
Well, putting that aside, I'm glad that you're healthy and all.

00:22:10.660 --> 00:22:13.620
As expected of the "child of god transformation" Kazune-kun.

00:22:14.290 --> 00:22:17.500
But it seems you haven't perfected it yet.

00:22:17.830 --> 00:22:19.000
You…

00:22:22.630 --> 00:22:24.000
A bug!

00:22:25.090 --> 00:22:26.550
Since when did he…

00:22:27.220 --> 00:22:28.340
It's cute.

00:22:28.340 --> 00:22:29.010
A bug!

00:22:31.260 --> 00:22:33.010
I have no words…

00:22:50.530 --> 00:22:56.100
Totsuzen no sutorii hajimaru yo

00:22:50.530 --> 00:22:56.100
The story has suddenly begun…

00:22:56.100 --> 00:23:04.360
Ring hikari dasu

00:22:56.100 --> 00:23:04.360
…with the ring shining.

00:23:04.360 --> 00:23:09.780
Ate no nai tabiji wo kimi to

00:23:04.360 --> 00:23:09.780
I'm on an aimless journey with you,

00:23:09.780 --> 00:23:16.250
Saa, hashire

00:23:09.780 --> 00:23:16.250
Come, let's run.

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:31.680
Ima ruriiro somatta kono omoi wo

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:31.680
Right now, these azure feelings that have built up…

00:23:31.680 --> 00:23:35.140
Yume mite koi shite

00:23:31.680 --> 00:23:35.140
…that I've been dreaming of, and love…

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:45.630
Sora made ukande hakanai anemone

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:45.630
…are floating up into the sky, like a never wilting anemone.

00:23:45.630 --> 00:23:52.580
Todoku koto no nai tegami hoshi no you ni

00:23:45.630 --> 00:23:52.580
This letter that cannot be delivered, will become like a star…

00:23:52.580 --> 00:24:02.380
So yo kaze sayonara aa…

00:23:52.580 --> 00:24:02.380
Yes, it will have have to bid the wind farewell.

00:24:05.760 --> 00:24:10.860
Micchi's Heart Thumping Hot Spring Tour

00:24:06.440 --> 00:24:08.320
Next time on Kami-chama Karin:

00:24:08.320 --> 00:24:11.200
Micchi's heart thumping hot spring tour!

00:24:11.200 --> 00:24:13.490
Padded kimonos! Mineral Oils!

00:24:13.490 --> 00:24:15.870
It's naked bonding!

00:24:16.740 --> 00:24:19.290
Why is glasses guy coming too?!
